<title>JAPAN: Daiei - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiei - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     1.24 trln	 vs	    1.26 trln</p>
<p> Operating	    3.87		vs	   21.91</p>
<p> Current		6.13		vs	   12.04</p>
<p> Net		    5.03		vs	    6.71</p>
<p> EPS		    7.05 yen	  vs	    9.40 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    714 million	  vs	 714 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.25 yen	  vs	    8.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiei Inc is a leading supermarket chain.</p>
